# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide demonstrates a simple working example to get started with the "
"`qiskit-addon-sqd` package. In this example, you can use SQD to obtain an "
"approximation of the ground state of the $N_2$ molecule at equilibrium.\n"
msgstr ""
"Panduan ini menunjukkan contoh mudah yang berfungsi untuk bermula dengan "
"pakej `qiskit-addon-sqd`. Dalam contoh ini, anda boleh menggunakan SQD untuk"
" mendapatkan anggaran keadaan asas molekul $N_2$ pada keseimbangan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To begin, recall that the generic interacting-electron Hamiltonian has the "
"form:\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk bermula, ingat semula bahawa Hamiltonian elektron-berinteraksi generik"
" mempunyai bentuk:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$ \\hat{H} = \\sum_{\\substack{pr\\\\ \\sigma}}h_{pr} "
"\\hat{a}_{p\\sigma}^\\dagger \\hat{a}_{r\\sigma} + "
"\\sum_{\\substack{prqs\\\\ \\sigma\\tau}} "
"\\frac{1}{2}\\left(pr|qs\\right)\\hat{a}_{p\\sigma}^\\dagger "
"\\hat{a}_{q\\tau}^\\dagger \\hat{a}_{s\\tau}\\hat{a}_{r\\sigma} $$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$ \\hat{H} = \\sum_{\\substack{pr\\\\ \\sigma}}h_{pr} "
"\\hat{a}_{p\\sigma}^\\dagger \\hat{a}_{r\\sigma} + "
"\\sum_{\\substack{prqs\\\\ \\sigma\\tau}} "
"\\frac{1}{2}\\left(pr|qs\\right)\\hat{a}_{p\\sigma}^\\dagger "
"\\hat{a}_{q\\tau}^\\dagger \\hat{a}_{s\\tau}\\hat{a}_{r\\sigma} $$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where $\\hat{a}_{p\\sigma}^\\dagger$ and $\\hat{a}_{p\\sigma}$ are the "
"Fermionic creation and annihilation operators associated with the $p$-th "
"orbital with spin $\\sigma$ and $h_{pr}$ and $\\left(pr|qs\\right)$ are the "
"one and two-body electronic integrals.\n"
msgstr ""
"di mana $\\hat{a}_{p\\sigma}^\\dagger$ dan $\\hat{a}_{p\\sigma}$ ialah "
"operator penciptaan dan pemusnahan Fermionic yang berkaitan dengan orbital "
"ke-$p$ dengan spin $\\sigma$ dan $h_{pr}$ serta $\\left(pr|qs\\right)$ ialah"
" kamiran elektronik satu dan dua badan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare molecule information {#prepare-molecule-information}"
msgstr "Sediakan maklumat molekul {#prepare-molecule-information}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To begin, specify the molecule and its properties using `pyscf` and the electronic integrals stored in `n2_fci.txt`.\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"This example ingests pre-generated data in a file called `n2_fci.txt`, which contains one- and two-body electronic integrals. To run the code cells below on a local machine, copy and paste the data into a file with the same name. This example also requires the `pyscf` package to be installed.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk bermula, tentukan molekul dan sifat-sifatnya menggunakan `pyscf` dan kamiran elektronik yang disimpan dalam `n2_fci.txt`.\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Contoh ini menggunakan data yang telah dijana terlebih dahulu dalam fail yang dipanggil `n2_fci.txt`, yang mengandungi kamiran elektronik satu dan dua badan. Untuk menjalankan sel kod di bawah pada mesin tempatan, salin dan tampal data ke dalam fail dengan nama yang sama. Contoh ini juga memerlukan pakej `pyscf` dipasang.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

