# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Obtain samples from an ansatz {#obtain-samples-from-an-ansatz}"
msgstr "Dapatkan sampel daripada ansatz {#obtain-samples-from-an-ansatz}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Once the molecule information has been loaded in, you should specify an "
"ansatz circuit and optimize it for execution. This involves considering any "
"symmetries of your problem, the choice of ansatz, and optimize it to run on "
"quantum hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"Setelah maklumat molekul dimuatkan, anda perlu menentukan litar ansatz dan "
"mengoptimumkannya untuk pelaksanaan. Ini melibatkan pertimbangan sebarang "
"simetri masalah anda, pilihan ansatz, dan mengoptimumkannya untuk dijalankan"
" pada perkakasan kuantum.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"However, these choices are problem specific and out of scope for this guide."
" Instead, to demonstrate the SQD workflow, we will generate a random set of "
"counts for the configuration recovery loop to post-process. This simulates "
"the measurement data of a 32-qubit circuit sampled with 10,000 shots. After "
"the count data has been generated, the `recover_configurations()` method "
"requires that you convert the count data into a matrix of the bitstrings "
"measured at each shot, as well as an array of probabilities for each state "
"that was measured.\n"
msgstr ""
"Walau bagaimanapun, pilihan-pilihan ini bergantung kepada masalah tertentu "
"dan di luar skop panduan ini. Sebaliknya, untuk menunjukkan aliran kerja "
"SQD, kita akan menjana set kiraan rawak untuk gelung pemulihan konfigurasi "
"bagi pemprosesan selepas. Ini mensimulasikan data pengukuran litar 32-qubit "
"yang disampling dengan 10,000 shot. Selepas data kiraan dijana, kaedah "
"`recover_configurations()` memerlukan anda menukar data kiraan kepada "
"matriks bitstring yang diukur pada setiap shot, serta tatasusunan "
"kebarangkalian bagi setiap keadaan yang diukur.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The artificial generation of samples is only used as a means to demonstrate the tooling of `qiskit-addon-sqd`. The package is meant to be used as part of a larger workflow wherein an ansatz or other circuit is defined, optimized, and executed using the Sampler primitive. The code cell below contains commented-out code demonstrating what a typical workflow might look like given a circuit ansatz transpiled to an ISA circuit.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Penjanaan sampel buatan hanya digunakan sebagai cara untuk menunjukkan alat `qiskit-addon-sqd`. Pakej ini dimaksudkan untuk digunakan sebagai sebahagian daripada aliran kerja yang lebih besar di mana ansatz atau litar lain ditakrifkan, dioptimumkan, dan dilaksanakan menggunakan primitif Sampler. Sel kod di bawah mengandungi kod yang dikomentari untuk menunjukkan bagaimana aliran kerja biasa mungkin kelihatan dengan litar ansatz yang ditranspil ke litar ISA.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run configuration recovery loop {#run-configuration-recovery-loop}"
msgstr ""
"Jalankan gelung pemulihan konfigurasi {#run-configuration-recovery-loop}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The measurement samples can then be refined by repeating the configuration "
"recovery and diagonalizing sets of subsamples to approximate the ground "
"state until convergence.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sampel pengukuran kemudiannya boleh diperhalusi dengan mengulangi pemulihan "
"konfigurasi dan mendiagonalkan set sub-sampel untuk menganggar keadaan asas "
"sehingga mencapai penumpuan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "First, specify the following options:\n"
msgstr "Pertama, tentukan pilihan berikut:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`ITERATIONS`: The number of self-consistent configuration recovery "
"iterations\n"
msgstr ""
"`ITERATIONS`: Bilangan lelaran pemulihan konfigurasi kendiri-konsisten\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`NUM_BATCHES`: The number of sets of subsamples to diagonalize\n"
msgstr "`NUM_BATCHES`: Bilangan set sub-sampel untuk didiagonalkan\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`SAMPLES_PER_BATCH`: The number of samples to include in each batch\n"
msgstr ""
"`SAMPLES_PER_BATCH`: Bilangan sampel untuk disertakan dalam setiap "
"kumpulan\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`MAX_DAVIDSON_CYCLES`: The number of iterations for the eigenstate solver\n"
msgstr ""
"`MAX_DAVIDSON_CYCLES`: Bilangan lelaran untuk penyelesai keadaan eigen\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As an optional step, you can define a callback function to log the details "
"for each configuration recovery iteration.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebagai langkah pilihan, anda boleh mentakrifkan fungsi callback untuk "
"merekod butiran bagi setiap lelaran pemulihan konfigurasi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now, run the configuration recovery loop. Each loop consists of three "
"steps:\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang, jalankan gelung pemulihan konfigurasi. Setiap gelung terdiri "
"daripada tiga langkah:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the `recover_configurations()` function to obtain a refined bitstring "
"matrix and probability array based on the average orbital occupancy.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan fungsi `recover_configurations()` untuk mendapatkan matriks "
"bitstring dan tatasusunan kebarangkalian yang diperhalusi berdasarkan "
"penghunian orbital purata.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the `postselect_and_subsample()` to collect batches of subsamples to "
"diagonalize over.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan `postselect_and_subsample()` untuk mengumpulkan kumpulan sub-sampel "
"untuk didiagonalkan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Then use the batches of subsamples as arguments to the `solve_fermion()` "
"function to obtain an approximation of the ground state.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kemudian gunakan kumpulan sub-sampel sebagai argumen kepada fungsi "
"`solve_fermion()` untuk mendapatkan anggaran keadaan asas.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"It is important to note how to address the first iteration of the "
"configuration recovery loop. Since the average orbital occupancy is not yet "
"available, only the `postselect_and_subsample()` function is called. This "
"removes any non-physical samples (samples with incorrect Hamming weight) "
"before running the eigenstate solver, `solve_fermion()`. Afterward, the "
"average orbital occupation is calculated across all batches and used as "
"input to the `recover_configurations()` method, which flips individual bits "
"probabilistically based on this average. See Section **II-A** of the "
"supplementary information in the [SQD "
"paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.05068) for more information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Penting untuk diperhatikan cara menangani lelaran pertama gelung pemulihan "
"konfigurasi. Memandangkan penghunian orbital purata belum tersedia, hanya "
"fungsi `postselect_and_subsample()` yang dipanggil. Ini mengeluarkan "
"sebarang sampel bukan-fizikal (sampel dengan berat Hamming yang tidak betul)"
" sebelum menjalankan penyelesai keadaan eigen, `solve_fermion()`. Selepas "
"itu, penghunian orbital purata dikira merentasi semua kumpulan dan digunakan"
" sebagai input kepada kaedah `recover_configurations()`, yang membalikkan "
"bit secara kebarangkalian berdasarkan purata ini. Lihat Bahagian **II-A** "
"maklumat tambahan dalam [kertas SQD](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.05068) untuk"
" maklumat lanjut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Visualize the results {#visualize-the-results}"
msgstr "Visualisasikan keputusan {#visualize-the-results}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Lastly, the results can be visualized by examining the approximated energy "
"and average orbital occupancy at each iteration of the configuration "
"recovery loop. The first plot shows that after a few iterations, the ground "
"state energy is estimated to within approximately `27 mH` (chemical accuracy"
" is typically accepted to be `1 kcal/mol` $\\approx$ `1.6 mH`). Recall that "
"this demonstration used pure noise, and that the ability to approximate the "
"energy to this degree comes from prior knowledge about the molecule and its "
"electronic structure.\n"
msgstr ""
"Akhirnya, keputusan boleh divisualisasikan dengan memeriksa tenaga yang "
"dianggar dan penghunian orbital purata pada setiap lelaran gelung pemulihan "
"konfigurasi. Plot pertama menunjukkan bahawa selepas beberapa lelaran, "
"tenaga keadaan asas dianggar dalam julat kira-kira `27 mH` (ketepatan kimia "
"biasanya diterima sebagai `1 kcal/mol` $\\approx$ `1.6 mH`). Ingat bahawa "
"demonstrasi ini menggunakan bunyi tulen semata-mata, dan keupayaan untuk "
"menganggar tenaga pada tahap ini datang dari pengetahuan terdahulu tentang "
"molekul dan struktur elektroniknya.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The second plot shows the average occupancy of each spatial orbital after "
"the final iteration. Notice that both the spin-up and spin-down electrons "
"occupy the first five orbitals with high probability in the solutions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Plot kedua menunjukkan penghunian purata setiap orbital spatial selepas "
"lelaran terakhir. Perhatikan bahawa elektron spin-atas dan spin-bawah "
"menghuni lima orbital pertama dengan kebarangkalian tinggi dalam "
"penyelesaian.\n"

